{
 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "In 1960, two men reached the deepest point on Earth.",
   "t0": 2,
   "t1": 6.37,
   "end": 9.77,
   "n": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "Before the sand clouded the window, one of them saw something on the bottom.",
   "t0": 10.27,
   "t1": 14.541,
   "end": 17.941,
   "n": 63
  },
  {
   "text": "They had no camera.",
   "t0": 18.441,
   "t1": 19.503,
   "end": 19.753,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody believed him.",
   "t0": 19.753,
   "t1": 21.135,
   "end": 24.335,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixty years later, a research team went back.",
   "t0": 24.835,
   "t1": 27.75,
   "end": 28,
   "n": 38
  },
  {
   "text": "With cameras this time.",
   "t0": 28,
   "t1": 29.654,
   "end": 33.054,
   "n": 20
  },
  {
   "text": "On the first dive, the lights caught a pale shape at the edge",
   "t0": 33.554,
   "t1": 36.646,
   "end": 36.896,
   "n": 49
  },
  {
   "text": "of the dark.",
   "t0": 36.896,
   "t1": 37.554,
   "end": 40.954,
   "n": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "It didn't swim away.",
   "t0": 41.454,
   "t1": 42.63,
   "end": 42.88,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "It held still.",
   "t0": 42.88,
   "t1": 43.68,
   "end": 43.93,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "Like it was watching.",
   "t0": 43.93,
   "t1": 45.506,
   "end": 50.106,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "On the second dive, it had a face.",
   "t0": 50.606,
   "t1": 53.154,
   "end": 56.354,
   "n": 27
  },
  {
   "text": "Two holes for eyes.",
   "t0": 56.854,
   "t1": 57.873,
   "end": 58.123,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "A slit for a mouth.",
   "t0": 58.123,
   "t1": 59.142,
   "end": 59.392,
   "n": 15
  },
  {
   "text": "Like a child's drawing of a person.",
   "t0": 59.392,
   "t1": 61.663,
   "end": 65.063,
   "n": 29
  },
  {
   "text": "Every time the pilot moved, it moved the same way.",
   "t0": 65.563,
   "t1": 68.624,
   "end": 72.024,
   "n": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "A second too late.",
   "t0": 72.524,
   "t1": 73.752,
   "end": 76.952,
   "n": 15
  },
  {
   "text": "But the strangest part wasn't that it copied them.",
   "t0": 77.452,
   "t1": 80.634,
   "end": 84.034,
   "n": 42
  },
  {
   "text": "It was that it was getting better at it.",
   "t0": 84.534,
   "t1": 86.628,
   "end": 89.828,
   "n": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "Dive three: eyelids.",
   "t0": 90.328,
   "t1": 91.785,
   "end": 92.035,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "Dive four: eyebrows, lips, teeth.",
   "t0": 92.035,
   "t1": 94.729,
   "end": 98.129,
   "n": 29
  },
  {
   "text": "The marine biologist said it was a known species.",
   "t0": 98.629,
   "t1": 101.493,
   "end": 101.743,
   "n": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "She couldn't name it.",
   "t0": 101.743,
   "t1": 103.014,
   "end": 106.414,
   "n": 18
  },
  {
   "text": "On dive five, it smiled at the camera.",
   "t0": 106.914,
   "t1": 109.638,
   "end": 112.838,
   "n": 31
  },
  {
   "text": "The crew realized it wasn't copying faces in general.",
   "t0": 113.338,
   "t1": 116.546,
   "end": 119.946,
   "n": 45
  },
  {
   "text": "It was copying theirs.",
   "t0": 120.446,
   "t1": 121.671,
   "end": 124.871,
   "n": 19
  },
  {
   "text": "The pilot refused to go down again.",
   "t0": 125.371,
   "t1": 127.667,
   "end": 130.867,
   "n": 29
  },
  {
   "text": "So the cameraman went alone.",
   "t0": 131.367,
   "t1": 133.064,
   "end": 136.264,
   "n": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "The tape recovered from that dive is 41 minutes long.",
   "t0": 136.764,
   "t1": 140.209,
   "end": 143.609,
   "n": 44
  },
  {
   "text": "For forty minutes, there's only dark water.",
   "t0": 144.109,
   "t1": 146.949,
   "end": 151.749,
   "n": 37
  },
  {
   "text": "Then the cameraman turns the camera toward himself.",
   "t0": 152.249,
   "t1": 155.218,
   "end": 158.618,
   "n": 44
  },
  {
   "text": "He's smiling.",
   "t0": 159.118,
   "t1": 160.045,
   "end": 162.395,
   "n": 12
  },
  {
   "text": "It wasn't his face.",
   "t0": 162.895,
   "t1": 164.296,
   "end": 169.096,
   "n": 16
  },
  {
   "text": "The sub came back up on its own.",
   "t0": 169.596,
   "t1": 171.469,
   "end": 171.719,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "The cabin was empty.",
   "t0": 171.719,
   "t1": 173.046,
   "end": 176.446,
   "n": 17
  },
  {
   "text": "The project was shut down.",
   "t0": 176.946,
   "t1": 178.412,
   "end": 178.662,
   "n": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "The footage was classified.",
   "t0": 178.662,
   "t1": 180.445,
   "end": 183.845,
   "n": 24
  },
  {
   "text": "Piccard never went back down.",
   "t0": 184.345,
   "t1": 186.073,
   "end": 186.323,
   "n": 25
  },
  {
   "text": "Until he died, he never described what he saw.",
   "t0": 186.323,
   "t1": 189.392,
   "end": 192.792,
   "n": 38
  },
  {
   "text": "Somewhere at the bottom, something has three faces now.",
   "t0": 193.292,
   "t1": 196.524,
   "end": 199.924,
   "n": 47
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe the question isn't what it is.",
   "t0": 200.424,
   "t1": 202.524,
   "end": 202.774,
   "n": 30
  },
  {
   "text": "Maybe it's whose face it wants next.",
   "t0": 202.774,
   "t1": 205.123,
   "end": 207.32299999999998,
   "n": 30
  }
 ],
